† d_floor > 0.8: the probes cannot place REAL legal outcomes much nearer the family than the no-event null (d_null = 1), so S_family has almost no range there and is uninformative.
‡ η_floor > 0.8 × η_blind: decoding the REAL legal frames already loses most of the gap to the mass-blind rule, so S_mom has almost no range (clipped to ±1) and is uninformative; 'undefined' when η_floor ≥ η_blind. Better probes or more groups are needed before S_mom can rank models there.
Cross-model S_mom must be compared on the groups every model scored: l1_forecast_laws.momentum_on_common_groups over each model's twins.legal.momentum.

